// DNS Query for a DDNS Provider Domain
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_dns_query_ddns_provider.yml (1ee55f5b-8397-41d7-882d-2e1acfe7dd62)
// Level: medium. ATT&CK: T1568 Dynamic Resolution, T1071.004 DNS
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"22") and (dns.question.name like~ ("*.duckdns.org", "*.no-ip.com", "*.no-ip.org", "*.ddns.net", "*.hopto.org", "*.zapto.org", "*.dynu.net"))
